OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's first health
OL,4,Acommissioner is appointed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Yorkshire has become the first
OL,7,Fplace in England to appoint a regional
OL,8,Fhealth commissioner.
OL,10,FFormer Barnsley Council Leader Sir
OL,11,FSteve Houghton has taken on the role
OL,12,Fwith the aim of tackling inequalities,
OL,13,Fimproving people's health and joining
OL,14,Fup services.
OL,16,FHe is expected to oversee the health
OL,17,Fportfolio on behalf of South Yorkshire
OL,18,FMayor Oliver Coppard and will bring
OL,19,Ftogether the NHS, local government, the
OL,20,Fvoluntary sector and wider public
OL,21,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
