OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's first health
OL,4,Acommissioner is appointed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has previously said it
OL,7,Fwas keen to give more power to mayors
OL,8,Fand devolved regions and chose South
OL,9,FYorkshire as a pilot location for the
OL,10,Fnew model because it had significant
OL,11,Fhealth inequalities.
